Aether source license boundary
==============================

Unless an exception below or an in-file notice says otherwise, project-authored
files under boot/, kernel/, drivers/, fs/, net/, crypto/, and lib/ are licensed
under GPL-3.0-or-later. See ../LICENSES/GPL-3.0-or-later.txt.

Project-authored files under apps/ and the shared lib/image/ sources are
licensed under MIT. See ../LICENSES/MIT.txt.

Third-party and generated material retains its own license. In particular,
crypto/trust/roots_bundle.inc contains Mozilla/NSS-derived MPL-2.0 data.

See ../LICENSING.md and ../THIRD_PARTY.md for the complete mapping.
